      "context_excerpt": "With its energy-efficient dual-reticle design, high bandwidth and large-capacity HBM3E memory subsystem, fifth-generation Tensor Cores, and breakthrough NVFP4 precision format, Blackwell Ultra is raising the bar for accelerated computing. This in-depth look explains the architectural advances, why they matter, and how they translate into measurable gains for AI workloads.",
