      "context_excerpt": "Multi-Instance GPU (MIG): Blackwell Ultra GPUs can be partitioned into different-sized MIG instances. For example, an administrator can create two instances with 140 GB of memory each, four instances with 70 GB each, or seven instances with 34 GB each, enabling secure multi-tenancy with predictable performance isolation.",
